{"qid": "FS2P", "q": "summarize the employee handbook leave policy", "source_id": 3, "scope": [3], "wall_ms": 10941.5, "item_status": "ok", "route": "rag", "n_items": 1, "kind": "rag", "status": "answered", "answer": "The leave policy requires employees to follow specific procedures for requesting leave, including obtaining approval from their reporting managers based on the duration of the leave. Sick leaves are limited to six per year, with a maximum of three during probation and require medical certification for more than two days. Leaves must be applied through HRMS on Matrix Platform (ERPNext), and employees should inform their supervisor about the submission. No leaves can be carried forward to the next year. The policy also encourages taking time off for work-life balance and well-being.\n\nSources: Sa", "citations": ["Samta-Employee Handbook April_2026.pdf"], "error": "", "trace_id": "9e270b1d4eae", "trace_total_ms": 10939.86, "stage_durations_ms": {"lifecycle": 0.0, "source_execution": 10937.7, "slm": 2.2}, "stage_starts_ms": {"slm": 10937.7, "lifecycle": 0.0, "source_execution": 0.0}, "slm_calls": [{"purpose": "rag_synthesis", "model": "qwen2.5:7b-instruct", "duration_ms": 10238.5, "ok": true}], "slm_call_count": 1, "llm_usage_section": {}, "retrieval_health": {}, "firewall": {}, "routing": {}, "federated": {}, "execution_plan": {}, "usage_calls": [{"purpose": "rag_synthesis", "model": "qwen2.5:7b-instruct", "prompt_tokens": 1116, "completion_tokens": 119}], "tokens_prompt": 1116, "tokens_completion": 119, "tokens_total": 1235, "embed_roundtrips": 4, "embed_calls": [{"path": "/encode_dense", "n_texts": 1, "ms": 277.7, "ok": true}, {"path": "/encode_dense", "n_texts": 1, "ms": 124.4, "ok": true}, {"path": "/encode_dense", "n_texts": 1, "ms": 94.3, "ok": true}, {"path": "/encode_sparse", "n_texts": 1, "ms": 67.7, "ok": true}], "embed_ms_total": 564.1, "rerank_roundtrips": 0, "rerank_calls": [], "rerank_ms_total": 0, "db_connects": 10, "db_connects_engine": 1